From 25bb5dc48cccfe1d9d7cea1b0e8e16f4d03e8b40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:13:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: import the vendor eccci and ccmni for MT6897
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Import, unmodified, the MediaTek evolved CCCI modem driver (core, state
machine, port layer, CCIF/DPMAIF/CLDMA interfaces, platform code) and the
CCMNI network device driver from the MiCode kernel_device_modules tree
used by MT6897 devices. They are not built yet; the next commits adapt
them to this kernel.

Link: https://github.com/MiCode/MTK_kernel_device_modules (commit 3c4ccd07d5624879555ec710c11bb8818e5cb5c6, drivers/misc/mediatek/eccci, drivers/misc/mediatek/ccmni)
Source commit: 3c4ccd07d562 "Kernel: Xiaomi kernel_device_modules changes for
Redmi K70E Android U" by 何发云 <hefayun@xiaomi.com>, 2024-01-12.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
